    "A REAL group answer needs more than half of the players to vote REAL. A tie counts as FAKE. A missed vote adds no REAL vote.": "超过半数玩家投真品，全体答案才是真品。平票算赝品，未投票不计作真品票。",
    "You cannot change a confirmed vote. Votes stay hidden until everyone votes or the 30-second timer ends.": "投票确认后不能更改。所有人投完票或 30 秒结束后，才会公开投票。",
    "The host chooses Auto, 60, 90 or 120 seconds to talk. Anyone can add 30 seconds once per round.": "房主选择自动、60、90 或 120 秒讨论。每轮可由任一玩家增加一次 30 秒。",
    "After voting, everyone sees the answer, the votes, and the changed clue.": "投票后，所有人可查看答案、票数及被篡改的线索。",
