    "Player Tools": "玩家工具",
    "Join a room or sign in to use the shop": "加入房间或登录后即可使用商店",
    "No WP for games with bots only. Play with another person to earn WP.": "仅与电脑对战不会获得 WP，与真人一起玩才能赚取 WP。",
    "Save this code and keep it private. To play on another phone, enter the room code, your same name, and this code. The old phone will be signed out.": "保存并保密此代码。换手机时输入房间代码、原来的名字及此代码；旧手机会退出该座位。",
    "The declarer names any card, for example the ace of hearts. Whoever holds that card is the declarer’s secret partner. Nobody is told who it is. The declarer may even call a card from their own hand and play alone.": "庄家指定任意一张牌，例如红桃 A。持有者就是秘密搭档，身份不会公开。庄家也可指定自己的牌，独自迎战。",
    "The player left of the declarer leads. In no trump, the declarer leads. You must follow suit if you can. The highest trump wins the trick, or else the highest card of the suit led. The partner stays hidden until they play the called card. All teams are shown when the deal ends.": "庄家左边玩家先出，无将时由庄家先出。持有首出花色必须跟牌。最大王牌获胜，否则由首出花色中最大牌获胜。搭档出示指定牌前身份保密，本局结束后全部公开。",
    "The deal stops as soon as either side reaches its trick target. If the declarer team wins, both score 1, 2, 4, 8, 16, 32 or 64 points for a contract of 7 to 13 tricks. If the defenders reach their target first, each defender scores 1 point. Unplayed tricks do not count as extra losses.": "任一方达到目标墩数，本局立即结束。庄家方获胜时，7 至 13 墩合约分别让双方每人获得 1、2、4、8、16、32 或 64 分。防守方先达到目标时，每人获得 1 分。未进行的轮次不增加失败处罚。",
    "Winner: the player with the most points after the chosen number of deals. A hand needs 4 points to be playable (A=4, K=3, Q=2, J=1, plus 1 for each card after the fourth in a suit). Hands with less are thrown in and dealt again.": "完成指定局数后，总分最高者获胜。起手牌至少需 4 点（A=4、K=3、Q=2、J=1，同花色超过 4 张后每张再加 1 点），不足则重新发牌。",
    "A deck of 52 cards plus one Joker is dealt out to everyone. Your cards are hidden from the other players.": "52 张扑克牌加一张鬼牌发给所有人，你的手牌对其他人保密。",
    "Whenever you hold two cards with the same number or face, like two 7s, they are put down automatically as a pair for everyone to see. The host can switch to four of a kind instead, but that game takes far longer.": "凑齐两张同点数牌（例如两张 7）时，会自动作为对子公开放下。房主也可改为四张同点数，游戏会更久。",
    "Players take turns clockwise around the circle. On your turn, take one face-down card from the previous player who still has cards. If it makes a pair, the pair goes down.": "按顺时针轮流操作。轮到你时，从上一位仍持牌的玩家手里抽一张背面朝上的牌，配成对子就会放下。",
    "You can shuffle your cards or move them around so nobody can guess where the Joker is.": "可以打乱或调整手牌位置，让其他人猜不到鬼牌在哪里。",
    "When you have no cards left you are safe. The game goes on until only one player still holds cards. That player is stuck with the Joker and loses!": "没有手牌就安全了。游戏继续到仅一位玩家仍持牌，该玩家留下鬼牌并输掉本局！",
    "Nobody can see anyone’s hand, only how many cards they hold. Pairs that have been laid down are shown under each player. If a player takes too long, the game takes a random card for them. If someone leaves, the game plays on for them.": "其他人只能看到手牌张数，已放下的对子显示在各玩家下方。等待过久时会自动随机抽牌，离开时由游戏代为操作。",
